{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55469","headline":"续父题壁（题拟） · 孟宾于","name":"续父题壁（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"他家养儿三四五，我家养儿独且苦。\n（宾于父。\n）衆星不如孤月明，牛羊满山畏独虎。\n（宾于）。\n（见《小草斋诗话》卷四、康熙《连州志》卷五《孟宾于传》）（〖1〗《连州志》：「父以家贫。\n且宾于无他兄弟，题其壁云〖诗略〗。\n宾于从乡校归，续曰〖诗略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟宾于","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}